{"title": "An EV is being sold every two minutes in Australia, ACT hits 36.5 pct electric share", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/04/an-ev-is-being-sold-every-two-minutes-in-australia-act-hits-36-5-pct-electric-share/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/04/an-ev-is-being-sold-every-two-minutes-in-australia-act-hits-36-5-pct-electric-share/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"An EV is being sold every two minutes in Australia, ACT hits 36.5 pct electric share\"><img alt=\"tesla model y lined up sydney\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/media-day-model-y-source-tesla-4-380x285.jpeg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Australians are buying a full battery electric car every two minutes, while in the national capital the electric share has hit a record 36.5 per cent.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/04/an-ev-is-being-sold-every-two-minutes-in-australia-act-hits-36-5-pct-electric-share/\">An EV is being sold every two minutes in Australia, ACT hits 36.5 pct electric share</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-03T18:36:45+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-04T08:44:05.016912+00:00"}
{"title": "Electrifying: EV sales are multiplying as fossil fuels lose control of Australia’s car market", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/04/electrifying-ev-sales-are-multiplying-as-fossil-fuels-lose-control-of-australias-car-market/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/04/electrifying-ev-sales-are-multiplying-as-fossil-fuels-lose-control-of-australias-car-market/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Electrifying: EV sales are multiplying as fossil fuels lose control of Australia’s car market\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/close-up-ev-car-electrical-motor-preparing-be-resupplied-with-electricity-380x285.jpeg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>EVs are no longer a sideshow; they’re the main act, stepping into the spotlight as the headliners from the age of oil shuffle offstage. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/04/electrifying-ev-sales-are-multiplying-as-fossil-fuels-lose-control-of-australias-car-market/\">Electrifying: EV sales are multiplying as fossil fuels lose control of Australia’s car market</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-03T18:30:14+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-04T08:44:05.016912+00:00"}
