{"title": "EV sales hit record 20 pct share in May, as Tesla, BYD, Jaecoo and Geely surge and diesel utes slump", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/03/ev-sales-hit-record-20-pct-share-in-may-as-tesla-byd-jaecoo-and-geely-surge-and-diesel-utes-slump/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/03/ev-sales-hit-record-20-pct-share-in-may-as-tesla-byd-jaecoo-and-geely-surge-and-diesel-utes-slump/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"EV sales hit record 20 pct share in May, as Tesla, BYD, Jaecoo and Geely surge and diesel utes slump\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jaecoo-J5-EV-Side-December-2025-Riz-Akhtar-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>EV sales rise sharply in May, hitting a record share of 20 per cent as the Tesla Model Y, the Jaecoo J5, the Geely EX5 and the BYD Sealion 7 led the way, and diesel utes fell sharply.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/03/ev-sales-hit-record-20-pct-share-in-may-as-tesla-byd-jaecoo-and-geely-surge-and-diesel-utes-slump/\">EV sales hit record 20 pct share in May, as Tesla, BYD, Jaecoo and Geely surge and diesel utes slump</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-02T16:59:09+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-04T08:44:05.016912+00:00"}
{"title": "EV sales numbers surge across Europe in May, and their market share too", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/ev-sales-numbers-surge-across-europe-in-may-and-their-market-share-too/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/ev-sales-numbers-surge-across-europe-in-may-and-their-market-share-too/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"EV sales numbers surge across Europe in May, and their market share too\"><img alt=\"Volkswagen ID.3 windfarm\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/vw-windfarms-DB2020AU01189_large-320x240.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"320\" /></a><p>Registrations of new battery electric vehicles surged across Europe in May, and while some countries are showing slower passenger car growth overall, the same cannot be said for EVs.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/ev-sales-numbers-surge-across-europe-in-may-and-their-market-share-too/\">EV sales numbers surge across Europe in May, and their market share too</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-02T01:46:55+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-04T08:44:05.016912+00:00"}
{"title": "Norway’s EV share at 97.8 pct in May, as Tesla leads Toyota and VW", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/norways-ev-share-at-97-8-pct-in-may-as-tesla-leads-toyota-and-vw/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/norways-ev-share-at-97-8-pct-in-may-as-tesla-leads-toyota-and-vw/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Norway’s EV share at 97.8 pct in May, as Tesla leads Toyota and VW\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Tesla-Model-3-Standard-Tesla-Europe-and-Middle-East-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>The share of electric vehicles in Norway’s new passenger car market came in at 97.8 per cent in May, delivering a 98 per cent share for the first five months of the year. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/norways-ev-share-at-97-8-pct-in-may-as-tesla-leads-toyota-and-vw/\">Norway’s EV share at 97.8 pct in May, as Tesla leads Toyota and VW</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-02T01:42:21+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-04T08:44:05.016912+00:00"}
{"title": "BYD ship with more than 4,900 cars – mostly EVs – docks in Melbourne", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/byd-ship-with-more-than-4900-cars-mostly-evs-docks-in-melbourne/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/byd-ship-with-more-than-4900-cars-mostly-evs-docks-in-melbourne/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"BYD ship with more than 4,900 cars – mostly EVs – docks in Melbourne\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BYD-Zhengzhou-Melbourne-Dock-Large-380x285.jpeg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>In a first for the Australian EV market, BYD's own ship arrives in Melbourne with thousands of cars to meet the surge in local demand.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/byd-ship-with-more-than-4900-cars-mostly-evs-docks-in-melbourne/\">BYD ship with more than 4,900 cars – mostly EVs – docks in Melbourne</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-01T22:31:10+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-04T08:44:05.016912+00:00"}
{"title": "Tesla hits record month of sales in May as Australia EV surge continues", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/tesla-hits-record-month-of-sales-in-may-as-ev-surge-continues/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/tesla-hits-record-month-of-sales-in-may-as-ev-surge-continues/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Tesla hits record month of sales in May as Australia EV surge continues\"><img alt=\"model Y new front\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/tesla-y-driving-front-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Tesla posts best ever monthly sales in Australia, hitting a new peak of 6,443 sales in May, as interest in electric vehicles continued to surge in light of fossil fuel supply crisis.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/tesla-hits-record-month-of-sales-in-may-as-ev-surge-continues/\">Tesla hits record month of sales in May as Australia EV surge continues</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-01T20:53:54+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-04T08:44:05.016912+00:00"}
